  "releaseNotes": "Added opt-in recursive placeholder resolution (EnableRecursiveResolution/MaxRecursionDepth on Options) so a replacement value that itself contains a placeholder gets resolved too, with a depth cap guarding against circular references. RequireAllParameters now also validates recursively-introduced placeholders when recursion is enabled. Replacement is now a single order-independent pass per round, so the result no longer depends on reflected property order.",
